  "html": "<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"nav-shell\" id=\"top\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Primary navigation\" class=\"nav wrap\">\n<a aria-label=\"Kartik Agnihotri, top of page\" class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\">KA<span>.</span></a>\n<div class=\"nav-links\">\n<a href=\"#work\">Work</a>\n<a href=\"#lab\">Lab</a>\n<a href=\"#about\">About</a>\n</div>\n</nav>\n</header>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\" class=\"hero wrap\">\n<div class=\"chapter-stamp\">\n<span>Portfolio / v1</span>\n<span>Chapter 01: OpenSense Labs</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hero-grid\">\n<div class=\"hero-copy\">\n<p class=\"kicker\"><span></span> Software engineer · India</p>\n<h1 id=\"hero-title\">I build web features that respect <em>people and their data.</em></h1>\n<p class=\"hero-intro\">At OpenSense Labs, I worked on consent-aware tracking, customer segmentation, personalization, automation and an early RAG proof of concept.</p>\n<div class=\"hero-actions\">\n<a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"#work\">See selected work <span>↓</span></a>\n<a class=\"text-link\" href=\"mailto:agni5kartik@gmail.com\">agni5kartik@gmail.com <span>↗</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<aside aria-label=\"Engineering profile summary\" class=\"hero-console\">\n<div class=\"console-bar\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"console-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>\n<span>profile.system</span>\n<span>01</span>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"console-visual\">\n<div class=\"radar-ring ring-one\"></div>\n<div class=\"radar-ring ring-two\"></div>\n<div class=\"radar-ring ring-three\"></div>\n<div class=\"radar-axis axis-x\"></div>\n<div class=\"radar-axis axis-y\"></div>\n<span class=\"radar-node node-one\"></span>\n<span class=\"radar-node node-two\"></span>\n<span class=\"radar-node node-three\"></span>\n<strong>RAG</strong>\n<p>retrieval<br/>proof of concept</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"console-data\">\n<div><dt>Focus</dt><dd>Personalization</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Mode</dt><dd>Node.js + Python</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Signal</dt><dd>Data use follows consent</dd></div>\n</dl>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hero-foot\">\n<p>Experience at OpenSense Labs</p>\n<p>Scroll to explore <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↘</span></p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-label=\"Technical focus\" class=\"signal-strip\">\n<div class=\"signal-track\">\n<span>Consent-aware tracking</span><i>✦</i><span>Customer segmentation</span><i>✦</i>\n<span>Personalization</span><i>✦</i><span>Automation</span><i>✦</i>\n<span>RAG</span><i>✦</i><span>Vector search</span><i>✦</i>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\">Consent-aware tracking</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</i>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\">Customer segmentation</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</i>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\">Personalization</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</i>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\">Automation</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</i>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"intro-title\" class=\"intro section wrap\" id=\"about\">\n<div class=\"section-index reveal\">01 / THE THREAD</div>\n<div class=\"intro-main reveal\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">A little context</p>\n<h2 id=\"intro-title\">Useful personalization starts with consent.</h2>\n<p class=\"large-copy\">I helped build features that used customer data according to consent and regional privacy requirements.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"intro-aside reveal\">\n<p>I implemented consent-aware tracking and customer segmentation workflows with Apache Unomi.</p>\n<p>I also developed backend personalization and automation features and explored retrieval-augmented generation (RAG).</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"work-title\" class=\"work section wrap\" id=\"work\">\n<div class=\"work-heading reveal\">\n<div class=\"section-index\">02 / SELECTED SYSTEMS</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">What I've shipped</p>\n<h2 id=\"work-title\">Tracking, personalization and retrieval.</h2>\n</div>\n<p class=\"work-note\">Associate Software Developer at OpenSense Labs · Jul 2023 – Apr 2024</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"case-list\">\n<article class=\"case-card reveal\">\n<div class=\"case-number\">01</div>\n<div class=\"case-content\">\n<p class=\"case-type\">Tracking / Privacy</p>\n<h3>Tracking that follows user consent.</h3>\n<p>Implemented consent-aware tracking and customer segmentation workflows with Apache Unomi. Data collection followed user consent and regional privacy requirements.</p>\n<ul aria-label=\"Technologies\" class=\"pill-list\"><li>Apache Unomi</li><li>Consent-aware tracking</li><li>Customer segmentation</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"case-diagram agent-diagram\"><div aria-label=\"v1 experience flow\" class=\"html-animation html-animation--mini\" data-html-animation=\"\" data-statuses=\"CONSENT CHECK|CUSTOMER SEGMENTATION|PERSONALIZATION\"><div class=\"html-flow\"><div class=\"html-step\" data-step=\"0\"><span class=\"html-step-index\">01</span><strong>CONSENT</strong><small>CHECK</small></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"html-link\" data-link=\"0\"><i></i></span><div class=\"html-step\" data-step=\"1\"><span class=\"html-step-index\">02</span><strong>SEGMENT</strong><small>GROUP</small></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"html-link\" data-link=\"1\"><i></i></span><div class=\"html-step\" data-step=\"2\"><span class=\"html-step-index\">03</span><strong>PROFILE</strong><small>PERSONALIZE</small></div></div><p aria-live=\"off\" class=\"html-status\"></p></div></div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"case-card reveal\">\n<div class=\"case-number\">02</div>\n<div class=\"case-content\">\n<p class=\"case-type\">Backend / Personalization</p>\n<h3>Personalization and automation features.</h3>\n<p>Developed backend features for personalization and automation.</p>\n<ul aria-label=\"Technologies\" class=\"pill-list\"><li>Node.js</li><li>Backend development</li><li>Automation</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"case-diagram document-diagram\"><div aria-label=\"v1 experience flow\" class=\"html-animation html-animation--mini\" data-html-animation=\"\" data-statuses=\"CHUNK DOCUMENT|CREATE EMBEDDINGS|RETRIEVE CONTEXT\"><div class=\"html-flow\"><div class=\"html-step\" data-step=\"0\"><span class=\"html-step-index\">01</span><strong>CHUNK</strong><small>SPLIT</small></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"html-link\" data-link=\"0\"><i></i></span><div class=\"html-step\" data-step=\"1\"><span class=\"html-step-index\">02</span><strong>EMBED</strong><small>VECTOR</small></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"html-link\" data-link=\"1\"><i></i></span><div class=\"html-step\" data-step=\"2\"><span class=\"html-step-index\">03</span><strong>SEARCH</strong><small>KNN</small></div></div><p aria-live=\"off\" class=\"html-status\"></p></div></div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"case-card reveal\">\n<div class=\"case-number\">03</div>\n<div class=\"case-content\">\n<p class=\"case-type\">Applied AI / RAG</p>\n<h3>Finding useful context in a knowledge base.</h3>\n<p>Built a RAG proof of concept using Node.js, Python, OpenAI embeddings, Pinecone and GPT-3.5-turbo. It covered chunking, vector search, KNN retrieval, cosine similarity and contextual retrieval.</p>\n<ul aria-label=\"Technologies\" class=\"pill-list\"><li>OpenAI embeddings</li><li>Pinecone</li><li>KNN · cosine similarity</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"case-diagram event-diagram\"><div aria-label=\"v1 experience flow\" class=\"html-animation html-animation--mini\" data-html-animation=\"\" data-statuses=\"CONSENT-AWARE TRACKING|CUSTOMER SEGMENTS|AUTOMATION\"><div class=\"html-flow\"><div class=\"html-step\" data-step=\"0\"><span class=\"html-step-index\">01</span><strong>TRACK</strong><small>ALLOW</small></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"html-link\" data-link=\"0\"><i></i></span><div class=\"html-step\" data-step=\"1\"><span class=\"html-step-index\">02</span><strong>SEGMENT</strong><small>GROUP</small></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"html-link\" data-link=\"1\"><i></i></span><div class=\"html-step\" data-step=\"2\"><span class=\"html-step-index\">03</span><strong>AUTOMATE</strong><small>ACTION</small></div></div><p aria-live=\"off\" class=\"html-status\"></p></div></div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-label=\"Work impact\" class=\"impact-band\">\n<div class=\"wrap impact-grid\">\n<div class=\"impact-item reveal\"><strong>CONSENT</strong><span>tracking based on user choices</span></div>\n<div class=\"impact-item reveal\"><strong>SEGMENTS</strong><span>customer segmentation workflows</span></div>\n<div class=\"impact-item reveal\"><strong>RAG</strong><span>retrieval proof of concept</span></div>\n<div class=\"impact-item reveal\"><strong>2023–24</strong><span>Associate Software Developer</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"lab-title\" class=\"lab section wrap\" id=\"lab\">\n<div class=\"lab-copy reveal\">\n<div class=\"section-index\">03 / AFTER HOURS</div>\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">The systems lab</p>\n<h2 id=\"lab-title\">A job scheduler I built outside work.</h2>\n<p class=\"large-copy\">A small, interactive view of a separate side project.</p>\n<p>The scheduler uses Redis queues and PostgreSQL job state. It supports scheduled jobs, concurrent workers, retries, idempotency and failure recovery.</p>\n<button class=\"button button-dark\" id=\"dispatch-button\" type=\"button\">\n            Dispatch a job <span>→</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"queue-lab reveal\">\n<div class=\"lab-topbar\">\n<span>scheduler.local</span>\n<span id=\"clock\">00:00:00</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"queue-stage\" id=\"queue-stage\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"queue-connectors\"></div>\n<div class=\"queue-node\" data-node=\"intake\"><span>01</span><strong>Intake</strong><small>request</small></div>\n<div class=\"queue-node\" data-node=\"queue\"><span>02</span><strong>Queue</strong><small>redis</small></div>\n<div class=\"queue-node\" data-node=\"worker\"><span>03</span><strong>Worker</strong><small>attempt</small></div>\n<div class=\"queue-node\" data-node=\"store\"><span>04</span><strong>Store</strong><small>durable</small></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"job-token\" id=\"job-token\">J<span>001</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lab-log\">\n<div><span>Status</span><strong id=\"job-status\">Awaiting dispatch</strong></div>\n<div><span>Attempt</span><strong id=\"job-attempt\"> - </strong></div>\n<div><span>Backoff</span><strong id=\"job-backoff\"> - </strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"projects-title\" class=\"side-projects section wrap\">\n<div class=\"side-heading reveal\">\n<div class=\"section-index\">04 / SIDE QUESTS</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Learning by building</p>\n<h2 id=\"projects-title\">Projects beyond this role.</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"project-grid\">\n<article class=\"project-card reveal\">\n<div class=\"project-top\"><span>01</span><span>Node.js · Redis · PostgreSQL</span></div>\n<h3>Distributed Job Scheduler</h3>\n<p>Built a scheduler with scheduled execution, concurrent workers, retries, idempotency, failure recovery and PostgreSQL job state.</p>\n<div class=\"project-foot\"><span>Reliable jobs, with clear state.</span><span>Built</span></div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"project-card inverse reveal\">\n<div class=\"project-top\"><span>02</span><span>C++ · Database internals</span></div>\n<h3>KragDB</h3>\n<p>Building a database system from scratch to learn about storage, data management and database internals.</p>\n<div class=\"project-foot\"><span>Learning from the storage layer up.</span><span>In progress</span></div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"principles-title\" class=\"principles section wrap\">\n<div class=\"principles-heading reveal\">\n<div class=\"section-index\">05 / OFF THE PAGE</div>\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">How I approach the work</p>\n<h2 id=\"principles-title\">Clear data rules. Useful results.</h2>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"principle-list\">\n<li class=\"reveal\">\n<span>01</span>\n<h3>Respect consent.</h3>\n<p>Collect and use data according to user consent and regional privacy requirements.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"reveal\">\n<span>02</span>\n<h3>Make information useful.</h3>\n<p>Use customer segmentation, personalization and automation to support product features.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"reveal\">\n<span>03</span>\n<h3>Retrieve relevant context.</h3>\n<p>Use chunking, embeddings, vector search and similarity methods in a RAG workflow.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"experience-title\" class=\"experience section wrap\">\n<div class=\"experience-heading reveal\">\n<div class=\"section-index\">06 / EXPERIENCE</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">The timeline</p>\n<h2 id=\"experience-title\">Experience and education.</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"timeline\">\n<article class=\"timeline-row reveal\">\n<div class=\"timeline-date\">Apr 2024 – Present</div>\n<div><h3>Fragmatic Technologies</h3><p>Production REST APIs, event-driven workflows, agentic AI and production support.</p></div>\n<p>Production APIs, event-driven infrastructure, provider-agnostic AI services and agentic product workflows.</p>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"timeline-dot\"></span>\n</article>\n<article class=\"timeline-row reveal\">\n<div class=\"timeline-date\">Jul 2023 – Apr 2024</div>\n<div><h3>OpenSense Labs</h3><p>Consent-aware tracking, customer segmentation, personalization, automation and a RAG proof of concept.</p></div>\n<p>Consent-aware tracking, customer segmentation, personalization, automation and an early RAG proof of concept.</p>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"timeline-dot\"></span>\n</article>\n<article class=\"timeline-row education reveal\">\n<div class=\"timeline-date\">2019 – 2023</div>\n<div><h3>Ujjain Engineering College</h3><p>Bachelor of Technology in Mechanical Engineering.</p></div>\n<p>The starting point for a lasting interest in how complex systems fit together.</p>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"timeline-dot\"></span>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"stack-title\" class=\"stack section wrap\">\n<div class=\"stack-heading reveal\">\n<div class=\"section-index\">07 / TOOLKIT</div>\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Technologies I work with</p>\n<h2 id=\"stack-title\">Tools I used to build these features.</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stack-grid reveal\">\n<div><h3>Languages</h3><p>JavaScript</p><p>Python</p><p>SQL</p><p>C++</p></div>\n<div><h3>Backend</h3><p>Node.js</p><p>Personalization</p><p>Automation</p><p>Apache Unomi</p></div>\n<div><h3>Data</h3><p>Customer segmentation</p><p>Consent-aware tracking</p><p>Chunking</p><p>Contextual retrieval</p></div>\n<div><h3>AI &amp; search</h3><p>OpenAI embeddings</p><p>Pinecone</p><p>Vector search</p><p>KNN · cosine similarity</p></div>\n<div><h3>Methods</h3><p>GPT-3.5-turbo</p><p>RAG</p><p>Embeddings</p><p>Vector search</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\" class=\"contact\">\n<div class=\"contact-inner wrap\">\n<div class=\"section-index\">08 / CONTACT</div>\n<div class=\"contact-copy reveal\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Have an interesting problem?</p>\n<h2 id=\"contact-title\">Let’s build what<br/>happens next.</h2>\n<a class=\"contact-email\" href=\"mailto:agni5kartik@gmail.com\">agni5kartik@gmail.com <span>↗</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"contact-links reveal\">\n<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/kartik-a-a6bb19269\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn <span>↗</span></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/KrAG2000\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub <span>↗</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<a href=\"./\">← Portfolio archive</a>\n<p>© <span id=\"year\"></span> Kartik Agnihotri</p>\n<a href=\"#top\">Back to top ↑</a>\n</div>\n</footer>",
